    feat(IA-311): add an effective hit point term to unit strength
    
    Scale every entry in the strength table by the square root of maximum hit
    points plus shields, so a Zealot prices at 2.49 Zerglings instead of 1.16.
    Drop the Ultralisk multiplier, which was standing in for the missing
    durability term.

